# 🕸️ KSP Sentinel AI — Phase 2: Network Analysis & Link Mapping Engine

## 1. Executive Summary & Problem Diagnosis

While Phase 1 established categorical/temporal visualizers (Bar, Pie, Line, Spatial Heatmap) and decoupled strategic advisory routing from tabular data queries, it lacks **multi-hop relational intelligence**. 

Real-world criminal syndicates operate across fragmented dimensions:
- A suspect in an extortion case shares a getaway bike with an accused in a burglary case.
- A cybercrime mule bank account receives UPI transactions linked to 5 different FIRs across 3 commissionerates.
- A single burner mobile number surfaces in CDR records of two apparently unrelated gangs.

Currently, tabular SQL queries cannot answer: *"What is the shortest evidentiary path connecting Suspect A to Case 87?"* or *"Who is the central broker linking the Whitefield and Indiranagar robbery cells?"*

This plan introduces a **Graphify-style interactive Force-Directed Network Visualizer** coupled with an **Entity Resolution & Graph Traversal Engine** that bridges seamlessly between the Chatbot and the Analytics Studio.

