## 4. First-Principles Engineering Blueprint (Andrej Karpathy Architecture)

### ⚙️ Engine Components:

#### 1. Graph Data Model & Pure Math Engine (`networkAnalyticsService.js`)
- **First Principles**: Zero heavy bloated external graph wrappers. Built on pure Canvas 2D / SVG physics with standard Euler integration:
  $$\mathbf{F}_{ij} = \frac{k^2}{d_{ij}} \hat{\mathbf{r}}_{ij} \quad (\text{Coulomb Repulsion})$$
  $$\mathbf{F}_{\text{spring}} = \frac{d_{ij}^2}{k} \hat{\mathbf{r}}_{ij} \quad (\text{Hooke Link Attraction})$$
  $$\mathbf{F}_{\text{center}} = -\alpha (\mathbf{p}_i - \mathbf{p}_{\text{center}}) \quad (\text{Gravity})$$
- **Dynamic Slicing**: Converts any dataset table into `{ nodes, links, communities, metrics }` in $<15\text{ms}$ on $5,000$ edges.
- **Centrality Algorithms**:
  - **Degree Centrality**: Immediate hub identification.
  - **Betweenness Centrality**: Finding bridge nodes connecting two crime syndicates.

#### 2. Interactive Network Graph Component (`NetworkGraphView.jsx`)
- **Features**:
  - 60 FPS smooth interactive physics simulation with pause/resume and drag-to-pin.
  - Zoom ($\times 0.1$ to $\times 4$), Pan, and Auto-Fit Bounding Box.
  - Node Color Coding:
    - 🔴 Suspects (Red `#ef4444`)
    - 🔵 Vehicles (Sky Blue `#0284c7`)
    - 🟣 Phone Numbers (Purple `#a855f7`)
    - 🟢 FIR Cases (Emerald `#10b981`)
    - 🟡 Hotspot Locations (Amber `#f59e0b`)
  - **Node Deep-Dive Drawer**: Clicking any node filters the entire graph to its 1-hop and 2-hop neighborhood, displaying Sec 65B hash and all linked cases.
  - **Crime Ring Cluster Filter**: Dropdown to isolate specific syndicates.

#### 3. Integration into Analytics Dashboard & Sidebar
- Add **"Network & Link Intelligence"** as a premier workspace tab in `PortalSidebar.jsx` and `AnalyticsDashboard.jsx`.
- Enable cross-navigation between Chatbot $\leftrightarrow$ Network Graph.

